<rss xmlns:ryspar="https://ryspar.dev/xml-namespaces/release" xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>Ryspar</title><item><title>Ryspar 0.1.0-beta.1 (3)</title><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 06:17:54 GMT</pubDate><description>First auto-updating build: Developer ID signing and notarization, the Liquid Glass icon, the daemon-lifetime fix (agent conversations survive app quits and crashes), and the Gmail SSO crash fix.</description><sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.1-3/Ryspar-0.1.0-beta.1-3.zip" length="34155662" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="agvYG8UdesCm2co4hmwPvB9ILOjVQYw1gfLsnFdURwiRjRiPfGcPMTDsMRuSB0tqugSd/4BKqN7TPlunr4MhBw==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.1.0-beta.1 (4)</title><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 06:24:52 GMT</pubDate><description>The first update delivered through Sparkle itself. If you are reading this in the update panel, the pipeline works.</description><sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.1-4/Ryspar-0.1.0-beta.1-4.zip" length="34155659" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Mq2PSoChc/ofo99XJSXueG0IpVB+BmhKioRYWJFhrjVdnTCXtb1BNpp+Z7I23XPi2e0qMs5x1gxyPtxXdqf3AA==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.1.0-beta.1 (5)</title><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 06:38:39 GMT</pubDate><description>The Updates page now tells the truth about the app's own row: version, build number, and where Check for Updates lives.</description><sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.1-5/Ryspar-0.1.0-beta.1-5.zip" length="34156015" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="JgMzx693BIHfNt+c2F5WWdMtqzBzdgATnXfq4UX4JTbvZqfLllaG5JpSvav1q9K5tI7x0D8s2COUX5+NVuMYCQ==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (6)</title><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:57:59 GMT</pubDate><description>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 brings the current dogfooding changes to the customer app.

- Bundled Ryspar host for local terminals, agent processes and backend tasks.
- Native artifact delivery and Point feedback, plus the latest sidebar, usage tracker, browser and settings improvements.
- Customer settings and data remain separate from the ryspar-dev app.
- Existing devices and browser data are retained. Saved workspace metadata is imported from the previous local backend on first launch; saved agents remain stopped until you start them.

Requires macOS 26 or later. Includes Apple silicon and Intel builds.
</description><sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-6/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-6.zip" length="25960109" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RgD/cjA9XRJyJyojzG0t52J8GtWnoMmz/gsedGRJgi5xEItLY/NavWwIlnSAU4evKCCz41ZVh+VEsRZ2Hc9nBA==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (13)</title><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:50:04 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ryspar is now a subscription, with a 7-day money-back guarantee. Sign in with the account you subscribe with on ryspar.dev.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Improved&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Point works on pages with strict security policies, and rings the button, field or picture you point at.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-13/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-13.zip" length="59305696" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Q7EGXRFJVMvyrmvURyyfiwXzdpp50Iw621V/faWQ8xsEJCzHnOjs5vIi+7exAhuygcYewG8c2XlJgGcDFKstBA==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-13/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-13.dmg" length="58744714" sha256="e88b0d54feac869eb61485de98d237a7b08ed46c5159e8eb0755f04705d4e8cf" /><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (14)</title><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:07:59 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Signing in and subscribing on ryspar.dev bring you back to Ryspar again.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-14/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-14.zip" length="59306304" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Gvt+5oI66uZslY9S2kCb94oiq3KEYCr42RMGSR18wHmRjin762u/W2seM0Sj0NvfDlaCSmwZZpEM8ymnioaJAA==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-14/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-14.dmg" length="58746004" sha256="90999aa79ef2be1a5449199ed8868f46a1f85954216755bcd8d3b5265268f784" /><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (15)</title><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 01:05:28 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Grok's minimal mode works in Ryspar's terminals.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ryspar shows Codex as waiting for you on its folder trust and hook review screens, instead of idle.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-15/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-15.zip" length="59314982" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zJesvzq6nvkR09/wVydn10zXSEsnZRWjx0U+LAwsSWixKU6d0z97i59y/vXLqGJ3a2p52knGyyE5d+dLSC8UBw==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-15/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-15.dmg" length="58758048" sha256="b7ef614f9464b5dcf833652cc3a9dcb08454caf5fab68028401c75c098c48be7" /><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (16)</title><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:01:05 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ryspar can set itself up on your Linux and Windows devices again.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-16/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-16.zip" length="120097369" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ZvA3CVBP0kJ3XPZE2Bz8WasLuAyV3MrgoF79Kqhko3mF3oSMeus7yvs74S3sq/bjmW6AMs/He0bDz9oLfYUnDw==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-16/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-16.dmg" length="120087367" sha256="1707fba4133633b1c380f52d62642bfd947e173a07f9bb115d7ac4514a0e7217" /><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (17)</title><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:39:23 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;p&gt;After this update, Ryspar may ask you once to restart its background service. Updates after this one finish on their own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Improved&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updates finish on their own. Once nothing is running, Ryspar restarts its background service and reopens your Claude, Codex and Grok conversations where you left off.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;While an update waits, Settings shows what it's waiting for, and Restart now finishes it right away.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:version>17</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-17/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-17.zip" length="120435493" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="s5cUDI3ZOlqLqd9BC2hbl1HHv2f1dQ1VsiX+Qn3a27S3UXDoiCnKgSc+HhLnZCnsRIwVeHcrwEYuvkN2oYMiAw==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-17/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-17.dmg" length="120410258" sha256="1c9182d040fd73dd51b0b4a14a622a3853c65d08aec8f9e5c793856b7eedc2f7" /><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (18)</title><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 20:03:12 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connected machines no longer block new workspaces, terminals or agents with a sign-in error. The repair applies automatically once no agents or terminals are running on that machine.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink><sparkle:version>18</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-18/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-18.zip" length="120430590" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="AX3Rvw06FAs0HUFkP6mACoRCoV9CYKn1d7oxPuxzgkhPU/QKuuBIKNV5ZsFDDbiqE3XjYCDvA5u1sRqLOIlhCA==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-18/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-18.dmg" length="120406020" sha256="470b3d55bde282601915580fc243d4472c15bb254ef2a2390fd434cf69663398" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (19)</title><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 05:13:08 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;style&gt;h3{font-size:1em;margin:1.1em 0 .35em}ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.25em}li{margin:.3em 0}p{margin:0}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Play supported videos and audio directly in the Files pane.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag files or folders from Files into an agent composer to reference their paths without moving them or sending your draft.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Improved&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Preview large images, PDFs and documents without the previous fixed size limit. Loading shows progress and stops when you close or switch the preview.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Large previews load more efficiently, and reopened files show their latest contents.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Development-server links appear when the website is ready and use the correct address, including addresses announced after startup.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SVG previews now follow the app's light and dark appearance.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://ryspar.dev/changelog</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink><sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-19/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-19.zip" length="120733058" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="V6NOKaK4/zII1zG4iJz2XallkOO/HHUBeeuK6ScMhAraabqodGBP9m7ekQJb3G4Kt4GmvS1xaE/qLpTwlaBVBQ==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-19/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-19.dmg" length="120708480" sha256="9907a04c3ec3710b4d09c69dbe0b6b58b6ea5bb582a7318616e71ec967021076" /></item></channel></rss>